---
import "./series-visual.css";
---

<figure
  class="session-diagram series-visual not-prose"
  aria-labelledby="session-recovery-title"
>
  <p class="figure-title" id="session-recovery-title">
    重新打开后，哪些记录进入 history？
  </p>
  <div class="recovery-grid">
    <section class="panel">
      <p class="panel-title">磁盘：保存的会话记录</p>
      <div class="node muted">
        <strong>较早的消息</strong>
        <span>任务、读取代码、修改过程……</span>
      </div>
      <div class="node summary">
        <strong>压缩记录 C</strong>
        <span>summary：任务约束与已完成的修改</span>
        <span>retainedTail：最近的测试调用与失败结果</span>
      </div>
      <div class="node">
        <strong>压缩后新增的消息 N</strong>
        <span>用户：下次先排查负数用例。</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note">以上记录均保留在文件中。</p>
    </section>
    <div class="connector" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="wide-arrow">→</span>
      <span class="small-arrow">↓</span>
    </div>
    <section class="panel restored">
      <p class="panel-title">重建：buildContext()</p>
      <ol class="history">
        <li>
          <strong>摘要消息</strong>
          <span>从 C.summary 转换而来。</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>近期原文</strong>
          <span>从 C.retainedTail 取出测试调用和结果。</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>后续消息</strong>
          <span>接上 N：先排查负数用例。</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <div class="continue">
        <strong>恢复到内存中的 history</strong>
        <span>等待新的输入：“继续修复”。</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note">较早的原始消息不再逐条加入本次上下文。</p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    教学示意：C、N
    用来标识图中的记录。重启时使用已保存的压缩结果，不重新生成摘要。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .session-diagram {
    margin: 1.8rem 0;
    color: var(--series-ink);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    container-type: inline-size;
  }
  .figure-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .recovery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 1.7rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .panel {
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: var(--series-paper);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .panel-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .node {
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--series-paper);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  strong,
  span {
    display: block;
  }
  strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .node span,
  .history span {
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .muted {
    border-style: dashed;
  }
  .summary {
    border-color: var(--series-blue);
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
  }
  .restored {
    border-color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .connector {
    align-self: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--series-blue);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }
  .small-arrow {
    display: none;
  }
  .history {
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .history li {
    padding: 0.3rem 0 0.7rem 0.1rem;
  }
  .history li::marker {
    color: var(--series-feedback);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .continue {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--series-feedback);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  .note,
  figcaption {
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
  }
  @container (max-width: 560px) {
    .recovery-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .wide-arrow {
      display: none;
    }
    .small-arrow {
      display: block;
    }
    .connector {
      padding: 0.35rem;
    }
  }
</style>
